GET choroid/sessions/{id}
Returns a session identified by its ID.

GET choroid/sessions/tags
Returns a list of all unique tags used in sessions.

POST choroid/sessions
Creates and returns a new session with the provided details in the request body.

POST choroid/sessions/search
Searches for and returns sessions based on criteria provided in the request body.

PATCH choroid/sessions/{id}
Updates and returns an existing session identified by its ID with the details provided in the request body.
The session start time can be modified only if the session has not yet started.

DELETE choroid/sessions/{id}
Deletes a session identified by its ID only if it has not already finished.